# BusTiket - Online Bus Ticket App

A desktop bus ticket booking application built with **Java Swing** and **MySQL (JDBC)**.
Users can register, search buses by route and date, filter the results, book tickets,
cancel tickets, and print an e-ticket.

**Author:** Ansel Makai

---

## Features

| Category | Features |
|---|---|
| Account | Register, login, passwords stored as SHA-256 hashes, logout |
| Profile | Round profile photo (change/delete), name initial shown when no photo is set |
| Search | Origin and destination cities, suggestion lists (boarding points and popular cities), swap button, calendar, Today/Tomorrow shortcuts |
| Filters | Bus type (AC, Non AC, Sleeper, Seater), price range (two-handle slider), departure time, bus partner, boarding point |
| Booking | Select a bus, choose the number of seats (1-10), confirm the total price, seats are deducted automatically |
| My Tickets | Ticket list with colored status badges (Booked/Cancelled), total/booked/cancelled statistics |
| Cancellation | Cancel a ticket, seats are returned automatically |
| Delete ticket | Permanently remove a ticket that has already been cancelled |
| Printing | View the e-ticket and print it through the printer dialog |
| Data safety | All queries use `PreparedStatement`; booking and cancellation use database transactions |

## Technologies

- **Language:** Java 17+ (recommended)
- **GUI:** Java Swing (custom components: cards, round buttons, range slider, styled tables)
- **Database:** MySQL 8.0+
- **Connection:** JDBC with `mysql-connector-j` 8.4.0
- **IDE:** IntelliJ IDEA

