## Entity Relationship Diagram

```mermaid
erDiagram
    USERS ||--o{ BOOKINGS : "makes"
    BUSES ||--o{ BOOKINGS : "is booked in"

    USERS {
        int id PK
        varchar name
        varchar email UK
        char password "SHA-256 hash"
        timestamp created_at
    }
    BUSES {
        int id PK
        varchar bus_name
        varchar source
        varchar destination
        date travel_date
        varchar departure_time
        decimal price
        int available_seats
        varchar bus_type
        varchar boarding_point
    }
    BOOKINGS {
        int id PK
        int user_id FK
        int bus_id FK
        int seats
        decimal total_price
        varchar status "BOOKED / CANCELLED"
        timestamp booked_at
    }
```

One user can have many bookings, and one bus (schedule) can appear in many bookings.

